<li id="main-traits_mwangi_expanse-fake-fn-3-target"><p><Link to="/source/blood_of_the_beast">Blood of the Beast</Link> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 3" id="backlink-main-traits_mwangi_expanse-fake-fn-3" data-hash-target to="main-traits_mwangi_expanse-fake-fn-3">↩</InnerLink></p></li>
